sec.p:
Diagnosis and treatment of cervicitis for pregnant women does not differ
from that for women who are not pregnant (see Diagnostic Considerations;
Treatment).

table-wrap-foot.p:
Abbreviations: ELISA = enzyme-linked immunosorbent
assay; HAV = hepatitis A virus; HBsAg = hepatitis B surface antigen;
Hep A = hepatitis A; Hep B = hepatitis B; IM= intramuscular.

